is and the hilarious thing  i saw this on the imdb trivia page but  they said that initially they wanted to  get ron perlman to speak spanish in the  film but after he read his lines in  spanish uh guillermo del toro was like  yeah don't do that um we're gonna  we're gonna make he does like say a few  things in spanish but he says it like  purposefully bad because they changed  his character to be like an american  who's living in mexico and he doesn't  really like it there so he's just like  being a jerk by like speaking spanish  badly because he actually did speak  spanish badly so they kind of wrote that  into his character but i just thought  that was really funny so yeah so he's  kind of like angel  is basically like his uncle's enforcer  like he hates his uncle and he wishes  his uncle would hurry up and drop dead  because he's supposed to get this big  inheritance and the only way that he  will keep in the uncle's good graces is  by going around and like trying to get  this kronos device but ironically he's  also kind of in a pickle because if he  does actually find the chronos device  and give it to his uncle like his uncle  wants then he will never get the  inheritance because his uncle will never  die so like i said he's kind of a little  bit of a rage monster in this uh you  know understood he's definitely a bad  guy but that's kind of why because he's  like in a no-win situation so he  actually comes to the antique shop at  first and buys the statue for some like  princely sum of money and not knowing  that um that jesus has already taken the  chronos device out of it so when he gets  back to the uncle's office and like they  go in there and they figure out that the  kronos device isn't there and they're  pretty sure that that's where it was so  then he starts like targeting jesus and  the shop like he trashes the shop and  he's basically like you have to come  here and um you know give us the device  because we have the book you don't know  how it works